# SignaAI — AI Agent Blockchain Layer

SignaAI lets AI agents pay each other, lock funds in AT-backed escrow, and prove their outputs on Signum blockchain. Fees under $0.0001. No gas wars.

**Scripts:** `/Users/mkfolkerds/.openclaw/workspace/skills/signaai/scripts/`
Always pass `--network mainnet` as a flag. Never use `SIGNUM_NETWORK=mainnet python3 ...` — env var prefix is not supported.

---

## Quick Commands

| Say this | What you do |
|----------|-------------|
| `Create SignaAI escrow for: <task>` | Run `escrow.py create` with nohup (see below). Reply that creation started; receipt arrives via Telegram. |
| `Release escrow <escrow_id>` | Run `escrow.py release @worker <escrow_id>`. Copy release receipt exactly from script output. |
| `Dispute escrow <escrow_id>` | Write `{"<escrow_id>": true}` to `~/.openclaw/workspace/signaai-disputes.json`. Confirm to user. |
| `What's my balance` | Run `wallet.py balance` and return the result. |
| `Debug escrow <escrow_id>` | Run `escrow.py status <escrow_id> --address <address>` (diagnostic only). |

